From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tessera <development@tessera.local>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 22:39:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Sinopia 26.3 data migration and source compatibility

Retain DataConverter through 26.2 and use vanilla DFU for newer schemas; do not run legacy walkers on 26.3 data. Adapt renamed RedstoneWireBlock references and removed imports.

